{"findings": [{"file": "src/sentry/incidents/grouptype.py", "line": 11, "severity": "high", "title": "MetricAlertDetectorHandler is abstract and cannot be instantiated", "body": "`MetricAlertDetectorHandler` now subclasses `StatefulDetectorHandler` but its body is just `pass`. It implements none of the abstract members: `counter_names`, `get_dedupe_value`, `get_group_key_values`, and the new `build_occurrence_and_event_data`.

